## Work

The PM finding says the Reedy bullet "Live in Tutor Advantage only. It is not in Primary
Advantage or Reading Advantage." is false: Reedy Preview is live in Primary Advantage since the
2026-10-20 cutover, and the PR copy has no such line. The PM order deletes the bullet in en and
th and adds a test that no locale string says Reedy is "not in Primary". The orchestrator extends
the order to the same claim in the two `platformFeatures` descriptions and to the zh bullet, by
deletion only.

Test added: `src/__tests__/www-tutor-reedy-claim.test.tsx`.

1. It walks every string value of both imported locale modules (pages and components) in en, th,
   and zh, and fails on each pattern of D-21.
2. It pins the six new strings of D-21.
3. It renders the page with the real dictionaries and asserts the Reedy block shows exactly the
   three remaining bullets in en, th, and zh.
4. One control case proves the scan rejects one probe per forbidden pattern.

No production file changed. No test reads production source as text. No test computes a hash.

